WEBVTT

01:49.680 --> 01:54.920
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.020 --> 01:58.020
[Episode 5]

01:58.070 --> 02:04.460
[Gentle Breeze]

02:19.240 --> 02:20.100
Your Highness,

02:20.310 --> 02:22.310
y-you've been sitting here
this whole time?

02:22.310 --> 02:23.590
She's already gone.

02:23.590 --> 02:24.360
I've put a tail on her.

02:24.360 --> 02:25.560
Nothing will happen.

02:29.120 --> 02:29.840
Your Highness,

02:29.840 --> 02:32.240
would you like to go inside
and get changed?

02:33.030 --> 02:34.140
Don't tell anyone

02:35.190 --> 02:36.710
what happened today.

02:37.430 --> 02:38.240
Yes.

02:38.870 --> 02:40.270
But I really don't get it.

02:40.280 --> 02:41.430
Why did you

02:41.430 --> 02:42.430
do all that today?

02:43.520 --> 02:45.800
I wanted to figure out the reason too.

02:46.680 --> 02:48.340
To see what kind of connection

02:48.920 --> 02:50.990
Song Yimeng has with me.

02:53.240 --> 02:55.079
You couldn't
bring yourself to kill her today

02:55.079 --> 02:57.600
and kept saving her
at the last moment.

02:57.680 --> 02:59.540
That wasn't your true intention?

03:00.240 --> 03:02.020
Was she using some kind of sorcery?

03:02.020 --> 03:03.350
What I just did to her…

03:03.910 --> 03:04.710
No, no.

03:05.150 --> 03:06.630
I have to make a trip to Longhu Mountain

03:06.630 --> 03:07.310
and hire a few exorcists.

03:07.310 --> 03:08.000
Look at me now.

03:08.000 --> 03:09.130
Don't upset me more.

03:09.900 --> 03:10.550
Yes.

03:13.470 --> 03:15.330
Back in the royal garden that day,

03:15.710 --> 03:17.770
I already thought something was off.

03:18.470 --> 03:19.650
Today in the woods,

03:19.840 --> 03:21.590
I planned to kill her in the chaos

03:21.590 --> 03:23.030
and pin it on Chu Guihong.

03:25.180 --> 03:27.440
But things turned out like this instead.

03:28.630 --> 03:30.230
Judging from what happened,

03:31.430 --> 03:32.690
it seems that no matter

03:33.079 --> 03:34.710
what danger Song Yimeng is in

03:35.310 --> 03:36.590
or where I am,

03:37.560 --> 03:38.310
my body moves

03:38.310 --> 03:40.190
on its own to save her.

03:42.680 --> 03:44.150
If that's the case,

03:44.520 --> 03:46.120
not only can we not hurt her,

03:46.280 --> 03:47.680
but we also have to watch out

03:47.680 --> 03:49.480
for others using her against us.

03:49.590 --> 03:50.800
If the Eighteenth Prince

03:50.800 --> 03:52.240
and Chu Guihong find out about this,

03:52.240 --> 03:52.590
we'll…

03:52.590 --> 03:53.590
That's why this matter

03:53.590 --> 03:55.030
must be kept secret at all costs.

03:55.030 --> 03:55.750
Yes.

03:56.120 --> 03:56.910
Also,

03:57.520 --> 04:00.050
we need to find a solution
as soon as possible.

04:01.400 --> 04:02.310
But Song Yimeng

04:02.310 --> 04:04.190
is still Chu Guihong's fiancée.

04:04.190 --> 04:05.470
If the two of them talk about this,

04:05.470 --> 04:06.280
then we...

04:11.030 --> 04:11.840
Exactly.

04:12.840 --> 04:14.960
As long as Chu Guihong
stays in the capital,

04:14.960 --> 04:16.190
he's a threat.

04:19.870 --> 04:20.950
Here's what we'll do:

04:20.950 --> 04:22.630
go bring Censor Yao Qian

04:23.070 --> 04:24.000
to me.

04:25.270 --> 04:26.070
Yes.

04:36.310 --> 04:37.120
Stop.

04:36.920 --> 04:43.110
[Yan Gate]

04:39.480 --> 04:40.270
Go on in.

04:45.400 --> 04:46.880
Other people travel into novels

04:46.880 --> 04:48.230
and live the dream.

04:49.360 --> 04:50.550
When I do,

04:50.630 --> 04:52.560
I suffer every possible hardship.

04:52.610 --> 04:54.390
Why am I so unlucky?

05:09.850 --> 05:11.190
We should carefully check every passerby.

05:11.190 --> 05:12.360
Why did you stop me just now?

05:12.360 --> 05:13.950
How many times have I told you?

05:13.950 --> 05:15.110
Keep your eyes sharp

05:15.160 --> 05:16.760
when guarding the city gate.

05:17.070 --> 05:18.630
Didn't you see the person

05:18.650 --> 05:20.110
behind that girl just now?

05:20.110 --> 05:21.860
That was the captain of the Xuanjia Army,

05:21.860 --> 05:23.660
one of the Seventh Prince's men.

05:24.750 --> 05:26.680
Are you saying that was Song Yimeng

05:26.720 --> 05:27.780
who just walked by?

05:29.770 --> 05:32.070
It seems that
she came out of the prince's manor.

05:32.070 --> 05:32.830
They were together

05:32.830 --> 05:34.190
this late at night.

05:34.750 --> 05:36.340
They must be pretty close.

05:38.950 --> 05:39.680
Guihong,

05:39.680 --> 05:40.600
when you get back tonight,

05:40.600 --> 05:42.070
take a nice hot bath

05:42.159 --> 05:42.940
and relax.

05:43.240 --> 05:44.390
If you feel unwell,

05:44.390 --> 05:46.000
just let me know, okay?

05:46.270 --> 05:46.920
Well,

05:46.920 --> 05:47.510
after I get home, I'll…

05:47.510 --> 05:48.390
Yimeng!

05:51.120 --> 05:51.870
Chu Guihong?

05:51.870 --> 05:52.510
Yimeng.

05:54.190 --> 05:55.390
What happened to you?

05:57.510 --> 05:58.310
I'm fine.

05:58.390 --> 05:59.190
I'm fine.

06:00.040 --> 06:00.830
You...

06:01.720 --> 06:02.920
You're out of prison?

06:04.750 --> 06:06.490
I was officially released
by imperial decree.

06:06.490 --> 06:07.580
All aboveboard.

06:09.120 --> 06:10.170
Good.

06:10.510 --> 06:11.940
As long as that scoundrel Nan Heng

06:11.940 --> 06:13.470
didn't give you a hard time.

06:13.510 --> 06:14.310
Don't worry.

06:15.720 --> 06:16.510
But you—

06:17.160 --> 06:18.430
he took you away

06:18.510 --> 06:19.580
right after we met earlier.

06:19.580 --> 06:20.880
I was so worried.

06:22.240 --> 06:23.000
Let me take a look at you.

06:23.000 --> 06:24.460
He didn't hurt you, did he?

06:24.750 --> 06:25.880
I'm fine.

06:25.920 --> 06:26.720
I'm fine.

06:27.750 --> 06:28.560
General.

06:28.870 --> 06:30.190
-You must…
-Yimeng.

06:32.430 --> 06:34.090
When did we become so distant?

06:36.560 --> 06:37.360
Well...

06:37.480 --> 06:38.270
Well...

06:38.909 --> 06:39.830
Hong.

06:42.480 --> 06:43.510
Hong.

06:43.600 --> 06:45.580
Nan Heng is ruthless and dangerous.

06:45.580 --> 06:46.840
He's hard to deal with.

06:47.480 --> 06:49.390
You've finally been released.

06:49.390 --> 06:50.560
So don't go against him

06:50.560 --> 06:51.650
in court anymore,

06:51.680 --> 06:52.320
okay?

06:52.340 --> 06:53.020
Yimeng,

06:53.560 --> 06:54.600
be honest with me.

06:55.040 --> 06:56.840
He bullied you today, didn't he?

06:57.390 --> 06:58.190
Sure enough.

06:58.630 --> 07:02.000
Second male leads are always
the ones the audience falls for.

07:02.000 --> 07:03.390
They're just better.

07:11.190 --> 07:11.950
Isn't this…

07:11.950 --> 07:13.330
This piece of jade was gifted to me

07:13.330 --> 07:14.600
by my aunt,

07:14.600 --> 07:16.310
the late empress, when I was born.

07:16.310 --> 07:17.600
It's protected me on the battlefield,

07:17.600 --> 07:19.730
bringing me home safe again and again.

07:20.020 --> 07:21.720
Now that we're getting married,

07:21.720 --> 07:22.850
I want you to have it.

07:23.130 --> 07:24.330
May it protect the one

07:24.570 --> 07:26.010
I love from today on.

07:27.080 --> 07:28.360
Even Nan Heng

07:28.390 --> 07:29.560
wouldn't dare act recklessly

07:29.560 --> 07:31.490
in front of something from my aunt.

07:32.560 --> 07:33.310
But

07:33.310 --> 07:34.600
if you give it to me,

07:35.010 --> 07:35.960
what about you?

07:44.040 --> 07:46.040
I have the scented pouch you gave me.

07:48.340 --> 07:50.940
During those dark days
in the imperial prison,

07:51.270 --> 07:53.470
it was the only thing that kept me going.

07:56.050 --> 07:57.790
But this jade is so valuable.

07:58.159 --> 07:59.190
My scented pouch

07:59.210 --> 08:00.190
isn't worth much.

08:00.190 --> 08:01.600
Then just make me a few more.

08:01.600 --> 08:02.800
I'll hang them here

08:02.870 --> 08:03.680
and here.

08:04.390 --> 08:05.680
Wherever I go,

08:05.680 --> 08:07.510
the air will be filled with fragrance.

08:07.510 --> 08:08.870
So everyone will know,

08:09.640 --> 08:11.020
your man has arrived.

08:11.070 --> 08:12.200
How does that sound?

08:20.560 --> 08:21.960
You're finally smiling.

08:22.980 --> 08:23.780
So beautiful.

08:28.720 --> 08:31.000
Every time our general sees Miss Song,

08:31.210 --> 08:32.020
he acts like

08:32.549 --> 08:34.480
a peacock spreading his feathers.

08:36.870 --> 08:37.669
Miss Song.

08:39.919 --> 08:41.450
Greetings, Your Highness.

08:42.549 --> 08:44.150
You and Guihong
have been engaged since childhood.

08:44.150 --> 08:45.390
Strictly speaking, marriage

08:45.390 --> 08:46.550
is a bond between two families.

08:46.550 --> 08:48.210
It's meant to last till death.

08:48.790 --> 08:50.170
But now Guihong's career

08:50.170 --> 08:51.290
is in jeopardy,

08:51.510 --> 08:53.750
and the rumors about you and Heng
are spreading like wildfire.

08:53.750 --> 08:54.670
So tell me,

08:54.670 --> 08:56.140
is the engagement still valid or not?

08:56.140 --> 08:57.190
Your Highness,

08:57.350 --> 08:59.010
that's between Yimeng and me.

09:01.120 --> 09:02.080
I'm your cousin.

09:02.390 --> 09:03.670
You're still an outsider.

09:03.670 --> 09:04.480
Guihong.

09:04.840 --> 09:05.700
Your Highness.

09:05.890 --> 09:07.320
In this world,

09:07.440 --> 09:09.720
the last person I'd ever get involved with

09:09.720 --> 09:10.670
is Nan Heng.

09:13.320 --> 09:15.130
We can't even be friends,

09:15.150 --> 09:16.550
let alone lovers.

09:17.200 --> 09:19.200
Because no one knows better than I do

09:19.440 --> 09:20.600
that he's actually

09:20.600 --> 09:22.440
a monster in disguise.

09:23.650 --> 09:25.060
So please rest assured.

09:25.120 --> 09:26.250
As long as

09:26.480 --> 09:27.270
Hong

09:27.670 --> 09:28.780
doesn't abandon me,

09:28.780 --> 09:30.590
I'll never betray him.

09:31.390 --> 09:32.560
Miss Song,

09:32.580 --> 09:34.690
you're actually so faithful.

09:34.720 --> 09:35.390
Great!

09:36.550 --> 09:37.550
Oh, you flatter me.

09:37.550 --> 09:38.690
I'm just speaking from the heart.

09:38.690 --> 09:40.150
If you like hearing it,

09:40.170 --> 09:41.770
I can say even more.

09:41.870 --> 09:42.870
Sure.

09:43.250 --> 09:44.460
No need, Yimeng.

09:44.510 --> 09:45.320
It's getting late.

09:45.320 --> 09:46.250
Let's head back.

09:46.260 --> 09:48.590
Th-then see you next time, Your Highness.

09:48.600 --> 09:49.600
Leaving already?

09:54.920 --> 09:56.180
What a perfect couple.

09:57.630 --> 09:58.710
Lovely.

09:59.590 --> 10:01.950
[Laiyi House]

10:05.920 --> 10:07.240
Be gentle. Be gentle.

10:08.240 --> 10:09.410
It hurts so much!

10:09.600 --> 10:10.390
Miss,

10:10.390 --> 10:12.390
you rushed out in such a hurry

10:12.390 --> 10:13.960
and came back like this.

10:13.960 --> 10:14.550
You've never

10:14.550 --> 10:16.670
suffered like this your whole life.

10:21.480 --> 10:22.670
I had a perfect life.

10:22.670 --> 10:24.900
Why did that bloodthirsty maniac
have to ruin everything?

10:24.900 --> 10:25.910
I'm telling you,

10:25.910 --> 10:27.120
my days

10:27.270 --> 10:28.750
are numbered.

10:28.870 --> 10:30.080
I think I'm dying.

10:30.080 --> 10:31.890
Don't talk nonsense.

10:32.480 --> 10:35.450
[Gentle Breeze]

10:36.100 --> 10:36.810
It hurts.

10:36.840 --> 10:38.010
It hurts.

10:42.360 --> 10:43.150
It hurts.

10:43.270 --> 10:44.270
Wait, I'm the one who's injured.

10:44.270 --> 10:45.400
Why are you whining?

10:45.970 --> 10:47.120
Seeing you injured

10:47.510 --> 10:49.440
breaks my heart, Your Highness.

10:49.480 --> 10:50.440
You've never

10:50.440 --> 10:52.440
suffered like this your whole life.

10:59.440 --> 11:00.500
Don't be dramatic.

11:02.050 --> 11:02.840
It hurts.

11:12.780 --> 11:20.130
[Iconic scenes in the script]

11:17.600 --> 11:19.040
According to the script,

11:19.150 --> 11:21.080
Nan Heng is full of schemes

11:21.080 --> 11:22.630
all for the throne.

11:22.910 --> 11:24.570
His attempt
to kill Chu Guihong in the kapok forest

11:24.570 --> 11:26.630
was to weaken the Eighteenth Prince.

11:26.650 --> 11:27.860
And trying to kill me in the chaos

11:27.860 --> 11:29.100
was to shut me up.

11:29.130 --> 11:30.460
I already know all that.

11:30.490 --> 11:33.130
So what was this whole

11:33.150 --> 11:34.680
"kill then save" act about?

11:46.910 --> 11:47.870
Could this be

11:48.210 --> 11:49.780
another script rule?

11:50.130 --> 11:54.990
[Slacker Escape Plan]

11:55.510 --> 11:56.320
So

11:56.600 --> 11:57.630
even if the script

11:57.630 --> 11:59.220
never included a scene like this,

11:59.220 --> 12:00.240
the "male lead always saves

12:00.240 --> 12:01.870
the female lead" rule

12:01.870 --> 12:03.120
still applies?

12:05.960 --> 12:07.280
[Nan Heng]

12:07.280 --> 12:09.570
[Nan Heng] [Song Yimeng]

12:11.100 --> 12:15.910
[Script Rule 1: If the female lead is
in danger, the male lead has to save her.]

12:17.420 --> 12:18.910
If that's the case,

12:17.540 --> 12:18.860
[Script Rule 1: If the female lead is
in danger, the male lead has to save her.]

12:19.150 --> 12:21.290
Nan Heng can't kill me.

12:22.080 --> 12:23.080
Yes!

12:22.940 --> 12:26.560
[Script Rule 1: If the female lead is
in danger, the male lead has to save her.]

12:24.000 --> 12:24.930
This is awesome!

12:26.870 --> 12:27.750
Mr. Screenwriter,

12:27.750 --> 12:28.750
thank you.

12:28.750 --> 12:31.150
You finally did something decent for once!

12:31.150 --> 12:32.700
Thank you, thank you!

12:36.720 --> 12:41.790
[Chu Guihong]

12:37.280 --> 12:38.540
In the script,

12:38.600 --> 12:41.130
Nan Heng keeps targeting Chu Guihong.

12:41.380 --> 12:44.360
He gets injured,
dismissed, and falsely accused.

12:44.390 --> 12:46.790
In the end,
after Nan Heng takes the throne,

12:46.900 --> 12:49.630
Chu Guihong leads the remnants
of the Qianyu Army into the palace,

12:49.630 --> 12:51.690
only to walk straight
into Nan Heng's trap.

12:51.690 --> 12:57.560
[Dream of Qingning,
Episode 36, Scene 6]

13:20.200 --> 13:21.200
Chu Guihong,

13:22.550 --> 13:23.510
your Qianyu Army

13:23.510 --> 13:25.310
has already been wiped out by me.

13:25.880 --> 13:27.940
You really think this pathetic force

13:28.600 --> 13:30.630
can fight against my Xuanjia Army?

13:31.630 --> 13:33.270
You overestimate yourself.

13:34.740 --> 13:36.300
Traitor Nan Heng!

13:37.030 --> 13:39.000
You murdered your own father for power

13:39.000 --> 13:40.660
and slaughtered your own kin.

13:41.060 --> 13:42.390
Your claim to the throne

13:43.090 --> 13:44.640
is illegitimate

13:44.750 --> 13:45.950
and unjust!

13:46.960 --> 13:47.750
Today,

13:48.840 --> 13:50.890
I'll seek justice for the people

13:51.040 --> 13:52.450
and take you down!

13:53.070 --> 13:54.260
Take me down?

13:59.640 --> 14:01.550
You've brought troops into the palace.

14:01.550 --> 14:02.910
To the people,

14:03.190 --> 14:04.670
you're nothing but a rebel

14:04.670 --> 14:05.840
and a joke.

14:06.580 --> 14:07.780
Killing you

14:08.360 --> 14:09.760
is perfectly justified.

14:13.350 --> 14:14.480
Chu Guihong.

14:16.120 --> 14:18.120
Your woman is now part of my harem.

14:18.740 --> 14:20.830
Your brother is dead by my hand.

14:21.460 --> 14:22.860
And now,

14:23.550 --> 14:25.000
I'm taking your life too.

14:30.930 --> 14:32.530
If you want someone to blame…

14:34.050 --> 14:35.120
blame yourself

14:35.690 --> 14:37.220
for choosing the wrong side

14:37.520 --> 14:39.010
from the start.

14:39.050 --> 14:39.660
[Guangde Gate]

14:41.720 --> 14:43.750
Miss, it's time for your wellness routine,

14:43.750 --> 14:44.860
just as you instructed.

14:44.860 --> 14:46.510
You scared me half to death.

14:48.660 --> 14:49.670
Xia,

14:49.780 --> 14:51.780
you're really good to me.

14:52.390 --> 14:53.200
But…

14:53.730 --> 14:55.190
isn't this tonic

14:55.330 --> 14:56.850
a little too strong?

14:57.080 --> 14:58.070
Not at all.

14:58.200 --> 15:00.150
The Lantern Festival
is just around the corner.

15:00.150 --> 15:02.550
The elders say
eating ginseng during the festival

15:02.550 --> 15:04.630
will bring good fortune
for the whole year.

15:04.630 --> 15:05.830
What did you just say?

15:06.300 --> 15:07.360
Lantern Festival?

15:09.130 --> 15:10.970
[Iconic scenes in the script]

15:11.000 --> 15:14.110
[2: Saving the Girl
at the Lantern Festival]

15:32.680 --> 15:36.760
[Yao Qian, the investigating censor]

15:38.910 --> 15:41.720
The evening breeze
stirs the candle's glow.

15:42.360 --> 15:45.560
His Highness leans over his desk,
not resting on a pillow.

15:50.870 --> 15:52.350
At midnight,

15:52.540 --> 15:54.660
not a rooster crows, not a dog barks.

15:54.840 --> 15:57.350
Your Highness, why have you suddenly

15:57.370 --> 15:58.320
summoned me?

15:58.350 --> 15:59.200
Get in here.

16:05.600 --> 16:07.780
I placed you in the Censorate

16:08.030 --> 16:10.430
so you'd keep an eye
on things in the palace.

16:13.670 --> 16:14.790
You should know…

16:16.190 --> 16:17.920
I have no use for incompetents.

16:20.540 --> 16:21.590
I'm sorry.

16:22.040 --> 16:23.400
I'm terribly sorry.

16:23.430 --> 16:25.270
Please, Your Highness,
give me one more chance.

16:25.270 --> 16:27.440
I'll dedicate myself fully,

16:27.460 --> 16:28.360
just like Your Highness—

16:28.360 --> 16:29.120
working day and night

16:29.120 --> 16:30.150
without stopping to rest.

16:30.150 --> 16:31.670
I swear I'll collect

16:31.670 --> 16:32.670
every last piece of proof

16:32.670 --> 16:33.670
of Chu's crimes.

16:37.030 --> 16:37.840
Good.

16:39.260 --> 16:40.520
I'll give you a chance.

16:41.570 --> 16:43.670
Then you know what to do

16:44.370 --> 16:46.370
at tomorrow's morning court, don't you?

16:46.370 --> 16:47.500
Yes, Your Highness.

16:57.360 --> 16:59.740
His Majesty has arrived!

17:03.320 --> 17:07.040
Long live Your Majesty!

17:07.790 --> 17:08.790
Rise.

17:09.349 --> 17:11.130
Thank you, Your Majesty.

17:18.920 --> 17:19.720
Father.

17:20.160 --> 17:20.960
Rui,

17:21.510 --> 17:23.310
do you have something to report?

17:23.480 --> 17:24.270
Father,

17:24.720 --> 17:25.589
I believe that

17:25.880 --> 17:27.880
although the Qianyu Army
suffered a setback this time,

17:27.880 --> 17:30.110
Chu Guihong
has earned great merit over the years.

17:30.110 --> 17:31.480
He's a rare military talent.

17:31.480 --> 17:33.070
How can we brush him off
with an empty title?

17:33.070 --> 17:33.790
Therefore,

17:34.000 --> 17:35.600
I respectfully request that

17:35.640 --> 17:37.830
you appoint Chu Guihong
to an important post

17:37.830 --> 17:39.550
and return command
of the Qianyu Army to him

17:39.550 --> 17:41.410
so he may defeat Heyuan once more.

17:41.680 --> 17:43.810
Regaining command of the Qianyu Army?

17:43.960 --> 17:45.350
Who else but General Chu

17:45.380 --> 17:47.590
is qualified to take on
such responsibility?

17:47.590 --> 17:49.840
But didn't he just lose a battle?

17:50.160 --> 17:51.260
Exactly.

17:51.400 --> 17:53.940
How can we promote a defeated general?

17:56.310 --> 17:57.110
Miss.

17:58.110 --> 17:58.920
How did it go?

17:59.160 --> 18:00.510
I handed the pouch you gave me

18:00.510 --> 18:02.790
to that attendant next to General Chu,

18:02.790 --> 18:03.880
Rong Hua,

18:03.880 --> 18:05.030
the big guy

18:05.030 --> 18:05.880
who's quite strong,

18:05.880 --> 18:07.670
but his face kinda resembles…

18:07.880 --> 18:09.110
No one asked about Rong Hua.

18:09.110 --> 18:10.160
He's not the point.

18:10.160 --> 18:11.240
I'm asking about Chu Guihong.

18:11.240 --> 18:12.130
Did he read it?

18:12.160 --> 18:12.920
He did.

18:12.960 --> 18:13.920
And as it happens,

18:13.920 --> 18:14.830
right after

18:14.830 --> 18:16.310
he read your message,

18:16.310 --> 18:17.790
someone from the palace showed up

18:17.790 --> 18:19.790
and summoned him to see His Majesty.

18:20.090 --> 18:21.400
Miss, what did you write

18:21.400 --> 18:22.790
in your message?

18:22.830 --> 18:24.070
General Chu's expression

18:24.070 --> 18:26.070
was really strange after he read it.

18:28.220 --> 18:30.190
He read it. That's all that matters.

18:30.190 --> 18:32.830
Good thing I remembered
that part of the plot.

18:33.080 --> 18:34.720
Otherwise...

18:37.960 --> 18:38.810
Heng,

18:38.840 --> 18:40.270
what do you mean?

18:40.510 --> 18:41.400
Every position I proposed,

18:41.400 --> 18:42.960
you shot it down with some excuse.

18:42.960 --> 18:44.240
You couldn't kill my cousin,

18:44.240 --> 18:46.700
and now you can't even
hide your intentions?

18:49.490 --> 18:50.480
Heng,

18:50.920 --> 18:52.680
since you think the posts Rui suggested

18:52.680 --> 18:54.130
aren't suitable,

18:54.270 --> 18:55.350
then tell me—

18:55.920 --> 18:57.030
what post do you think

18:57.030 --> 18:58.480
Chu Guihong deserves?

19:00.920 --> 19:01.790
Your Majesty,

19:02.440 --> 19:03.310
in my opinion,

19:03.350 --> 19:05.110
when discussing matters of court,

19:05.110 --> 19:06.910
the public good must come first.

19:07.310 --> 19:09.470
If we give Chu Guihong a high position,

19:10.310 --> 19:12.770
we'll be putting personal interests first.

19:15.610 --> 19:17.940
If appointing the right person for the job

19:18.000 --> 19:20.070
is putting personal interests first,

19:20.070 --> 19:21.920
are you saying

19:21.920 --> 19:24.030
only when the court
is full of the Gao family's people

19:22.190 --> 19:23.630
[Calm, Respectful, and Sincere]

19:27.310 --> 19:29.640
can we say we've put
the public good first?

19:32.880 --> 19:34.360
You must be joking, Your Majesty.

19:34.360 --> 19:35.400
The Duke of Zhou welcomed talent

19:35.400 --> 19:36.830
and won hearts across the land.

19:36.830 --> 19:38.160
Helping you unite the nation

19:38.160 --> 19:40.070
and recruit men of virtue and talent

19:40.070 --> 19:41.070
is what we've

19:41.090 --> 19:42.610
always striven to do.

19:43.440 --> 19:44.240
Your Majesty.

19:45.070 --> 19:46.240
Chu Guihong may

19:46.270 --> 19:48.400
have had a good reputation in the past,

19:49.000 --> 19:51.000
but after the Pingrong Battle,

19:51.440 --> 19:54.700
his command led to
the loss of tens of thousands of soldiers

19:55.030 --> 19:56.790
and the slaughter of civilians

19:56.830 --> 19:58.160
in three border cities.

19:58.270 --> 19:59.070
As a result,

19:59.400 --> 20:01.530
his reputation is already tarnished.

20:01.750 --> 20:03.350
I worry that reinstating him

20:03.790 --> 20:05.480
will only dishearten the people.

20:05.480 --> 20:06.280
Your Majesty.

20:08.200 --> 20:09.850
[Calm, Respectful, and Sincere]

20:09.070 --> 20:10.480
Greetings, Your Majesty.

20:10.480 --> 20:11.310
Rise.

20:11.410 --> 20:12.810
Thank you, Your Majesty.

20:15.640 --> 20:17.350
Seventh Prince,

20:17.440 --> 20:18.900
you said my reputation is tarnished now.

20:18.900 --> 20:20.680
What evidence are you basing that on?

20:20.680 --> 20:22.140
Naturally, it's backed by

20:22.160 --> 20:23.760
a Censorate investigation.

20:25.070 --> 20:25.880
Your Majesty,

20:26.750 --> 20:28.000
I request that

20:28.020 --> 20:29.540
the investigating censor

20:29.570 --> 20:32.590
present the Censorate's impeachment
memorial against Chu Guihong

20:32.590 --> 20:33.990
and explain the details.

20:34.160 --> 20:35.240
Seriously?

20:35.240 --> 20:36.970
You came prepared, didn't you?

20:38.480 --> 20:39.270
Summon him.

20:43.380 --> 20:44.120
[Memorial]

21:25.180 --> 21:26.170
Seventh Prince,

21:26.900 --> 21:28.840
may I ask how much longer

21:28.880 --> 21:31.050
until the impeachment memorial arrives?

21:31.050 --> 21:32.190
Yeah, Heng,

21:32.430 --> 21:34.800
it's almost noon now.

21:36.350 --> 21:37.720
Don't tell me you sent someone

21:37.720 --> 21:39.300
to write it on the spot.

21:40.550 --> 21:41.410
Your Highness,

21:42.040 --> 21:44.300
there's something fishy about all this.

21:44.500 --> 21:45.260
Maybe…

21:45.360 --> 21:46.560
Wait a little longer.

21:54.030 --> 21:55.020
Guess

21:55.960 --> 21:57.550
I'm really hungry.

21:58.310 --> 21:59.110
Well,

21:59.110 --> 22:01.080
putting the right people
in charge matters,

22:01.080 --> 22:02.280
but not more than

22:02.310 --> 22:03.400
Father's health.

22:03.750 --> 22:05.160
If we wait any longer,

22:05.270 --> 22:06.590
we could skip lunch

22:06.720 --> 22:08.440
and have dinner directly.

22:08.460 --> 22:09.220
Enough.

22:09.880 --> 22:11.610
Since no one has any objections

22:11.750 --> 22:13.600
to reinstating Chu Guihong,

22:14.110 --> 22:16.530
he shall be appointed
as the Prefect of the Capital

22:16.530 --> 22:17.800
and Commander of the Army,

22:17.800 --> 22:19.100
resuming leadership of the Qianyu Army

22:19.100 --> 22:20.210
to guard the capital.

22:20.210 --> 22:21.100
In an emergency,

22:21.100 --> 22:22.430
he can act with full discretion.

22:22.430 --> 22:23.700
He can also enter the palace armed

22:23.700 --> 22:25.100
to report directly to me.

22:32.280 --> 22:33.830
Congratulations, General Chu.

22:33.830 --> 22:34.660
No,

22:35.040 --> 22:36.730
now we should be calling you

22:36.920 --> 22:38.160
Commander Chu

22:38.160 --> 22:39.350
or Prefect of the Capital.

22:39.350 --> 22:40.480
It's a great responsibility.

22:40.480 --> 22:41.340
I'll do my best.

22:41.400 --> 22:42.260
I hope all of you

22:42.270 --> 22:43.000
can guide and support me…

22:43.000 --> 22:43.270
Your Highness.

22:43.270 --> 22:44.110
In the days to come.

22:44.110 --> 22:45.310
Just now, Mr. Yao was blindfolded,

22:45.310 --> 22:46.030
beaten,

22:46.030 --> 22:48.240
and left in an abandoned mine
on the western outskirts.

22:48.240 --> 22:49.350
By the time we got there,

22:49.350 --> 22:51.550
the place had already been cleaned out.

22:59.460 --> 23:00.790
No need to investigate.

23:01.120 --> 23:03.180
It must've been Chu Guihong's doing.

23:04.270 --> 23:05.870
But what I can't figure out is

23:06.550 --> 23:08.840
how he knew where Yao Qian was.

23:09.020 --> 23:10.050
Your Highness.

23:10.110 --> 23:10.920
Last night,

23:11.000 --> 23:13.160
we sent someone to tail Miss Song.

23:13.180 --> 23:14.950
She ran into Chu Guihong on the road.

23:14.950 --> 23:15.870
And this morning,

23:15.870 --> 23:16.680
a maid from her house

23:16.680 --> 23:18.550
secretly paid a visit to the Chu family.

23:18.550 --> 23:20.090
Do you think they might…

23:32.250 --> 23:33.060
Mr. Song.

23:33.680 --> 23:34.480
Come, come.

23:34.510 --> 23:35.590
Have a seat.

23:42.110 --> 23:44.930
I remember when you visited us as a child,

23:45.110 --> 23:46.270
your favorite treat

23:46.430 --> 23:48.090
was always the crystal cake.

23:48.310 --> 23:49.310
Go on, have a bite.

23:52.880 --> 23:53.680
Yes.

23:54.810 --> 23:56.610
Yimeng loves crystal cakes too.

23:56.910 --> 23:58.040
When we were little,

23:59.640 --> 24:01.570
she used to steal mine all the time.

24:06.970 --> 24:08.260
That's a rude thing to say.

24:08.260 --> 24:09.860
Please forgive me, Mr. Song.

24:10.350 --> 24:11.160
It's fine.

24:11.550 --> 24:14.230
Your father and I
have been close for years.

24:14.260 --> 24:16.510
You and Yimeng have been engaged
since you were young.

24:16.510 --> 24:17.790
In my eyes,

24:18.180 --> 24:20.610
you're already family.

24:20.880 --> 24:22.480
No need to stand on ceremony.

24:26.000 --> 24:27.000
That blade of yours…

24:27.000 --> 24:27.790
My Lord.

24:28.200 --> 24:29.310
It hasn't been sharpened.

24:29.310 --> 24:31.240
Yeah, I'll take care of that today.

24:33.760 --> 24:35.010
[Song Residence]

24:39.110 --> 24:39.970
Your Highness,

24:40.510 --> 24:41.840
Chu Guihong's here too.

24:47.010 --> 24:54.210
[Room of Elegance]

24:55.200 --> 24:56.030
Miss,

24:56.030 --> 24:57.720
aren't you the most afraid
of the Seventh Prince?

24:57.720 --> 24:59.030
He's literally barging in right now,

24:59.030 --> 25:01.090
and you're not the least bit nervous?

25:01.480 --> 25:03.880
When I sent word
to Chu Guihong this morning,

25:03.880 --> 25:05.790
I already knew Nan Heng would come.

25:05.790 --> 25:07.030
Relax.

25:07.030 --> 25:08.590
He can't kill me now.

25:08.610 --> 25:09.970
I'm not afraid of him.

25:16.320 --> 25:17.770
Your Highness.

25:26.790 --> 25:28.980
How could they serve such cheap tea

25:29.200 --> 25:31.670
to the distinguished Seventh Prince?

25:31.770 --> 25:32.680
Yingqiu,

25:32.710 --> 25:34.600
go bring my premium ginseng tea.

25:34.640 --> 25:35.070
Yes.

25:35.070 --> 25:35.790
Zhixia,

25:35.830 --> 25:36.790
where are the pastries?

25:36.790 --> 25:38.480
Four sweet ones, four savory ones—
don't miss a single one.

25:38.480 --> 25:39.070
Go, go.

25:39.070 --> 25:40.510
Bring them to the Seventh Prince.

25:40.240 --> 25:48.150
[Laiyi House]

25:40.530 --> 25:41.340
Go.

25:43.750 --> 25:44.640
Your Highness,

25:44.790 --> 25:46.240
please wait a little longer.

25:46.240 --> 25:47.310
The premium tea

25:47.400 --> 25:48.800
will be served in no time.

25:53.920 --> 25:54.880
My goodness!

25:56.750 --> 25:57.830
Look at your ears—

25:57.830 --> 25:59.160
they're bright red!

25:59.160 --> 25:59.920
Fugui!

25:59.960 --> 26:01.200
I'm not trying to scold you,

26:01.200 --> 26:02.240
but you really need

26:02.240 --> 26:03.590
to learn how to serve properly.

26:03.590 --> 26:04.590
It's freezing today,

26:04.590 --> 26:06.480
and you didn't even prepare
a fur coat for your master.

26:06.480 --> 26:07.810
Totally unacceptable!

26:10.130 --> 26:11.330
Here, Your Highness.

26:11.690 --> 26:12.830
Warm your hands.

26:13.260 --> 26:14.470
Warm your hands.

26:21.510 --> 26:22.310
Fugui.

26:22.640 --> 26:23.440
Get out.

26:24.580 --> 26:25.390
Get out!

26:30.320 --> 26:31.470
Get out!

26:38.550 --> 26:39.440
Now tell me—

26:40.530 --> 26:42.400
did you meet with Chu Guihong?

26:44.800 --> 26:45.670
Sure did.

26:46.070 --> 26:47.310
He and I

26:47.330 --> 26:48.840
are engaged, after all.

26:49.240 --> 26:51.070
Do I need your permission to see him?

26:51.070 --> 26:51.880
What?

26:51.900 --> 26:53.660
Working under you

26:54.030 --> 26:55.760
means I'm not allowed to marry?

26:58.070 --> 27:00.610
You've got a lot of nerve
talking to me like that.

27:00.610 --> 27:02.410
You're not afraid of me anymore?

27:03.030 --> 27:04.030
I am afraid.

27:04.280 --> 27:05.780
Even terrified.

27:05.810 --> 27:07.330
I'm shaking in my boots.

27:21.480 --> 27:22.340
Your Highness.

27:22.730 --> 27:24.330
There's a dagger right here.

27:24.640 --> 27:26.270
Go ahead, kill me.

27:28.770 --> 27:30.030
Oh wait, I forgot.

27:30.400 --> 27:31.990
You can't kill me.

27:34.070 --> 27:36.000
No matter how hard you try,

27:36.030 --> 27:37.430
the only one who ends up hurt

27:37.430 --> 27:38.790
is you.

27:46.250 --> 27:47.710
By the way, Your Highness,

27:47.910 --> 27:50.780
do those three dart wounds in your back

27:51.070 --> 27:52.510
still hurt?

28:01.920 --> 28:02.880
Nightwalkers?

28:04.160 --> 28:06.620
Sounds like
they're from the martial world.

28:07.030 --> 28:07.830
That's right.

28:08.830 --> 28:10.030
From what I've heard,

28:10.510 --> 28:13.010
they were originally
skilled fighters from the martial world.

28:13.010 --> 28:14.110
Three years ago,

28:14.200 --> 28:15.980
a mysterious person gathered them up,

28:15.980 --> 28:17.170
trained them,

28:17.280 --> 28:19.640
and made them an elite force.

28:21.000 --> 28:22.550
Their leader

28:23.110 --> 28:24.570
seems to be quite capable.

28:26.570 --> 28:29.750
This person secretly formed
the Nightwalkers within the country,

28:29.750 --> 28:30.590
and outside the country,

28:30.590 --> 28:32.350
he used a guild
called Waning River Crescent

28:32.350 --> 28:34.130
to build connections in lodging, gambling,

28:34.130 --> 28:35.590
restaurants, and so on.

28:35.650 --> 28:37.550
Anything you can't do openly—

28:37.640 --> 28:38.880
you can do it

28:38.880 --> 28:40.350
at Waning River Crescent.

28:43.070 --> 28:45.290
I heard a bit about it
while I was in prison.

28:45.290 --> 28:48.270
Waning River Crescent
is located in a shady, chaotic area.

28:48.270 --> 28:50.270
After dark, it's total mayhem.

28:50.410 --> 28:51.500
There's always

28:51.590 --> 28:53.310
something shady going on.

28:54.750 --> 28:56.050
The so-called guild

28:56.360 --> 28:59.240
sounds more like a cover
for the Nightwalkers' operations.

28:59.240 --> 29:00.630
That's why

29:00.960 --> 29:03.290
the court's troubled.

29:05.470 --> 29:06.980
You mean...

29:07.450 --> 29:08.590
Hong,

29:09.640 --> 29:11.170
I need to know that

29:11.200 --> 29:13.140
at court,

29:13.640 --> 29:15.180
sometimes when the wind blows,

29:15.180 --> 29:16.360
it really is wind,

29:16.790 --> 29:17.720
and sometimes,

29:18.600 --> 29:20.280
it's not.

29:23.110 --> 29:24.850
Thank you for the guidance.

29:25.950 --> 29:27.100
Well,

29:27.730 --> 29:29.250
I didn't say anything.

29:31.200 --> 29:32.000
Of course.

29:32.320 --> 29:33.840
You said nothing at all.

29:33.870 --> 29:35.160
It's just that I suddenly

29:35.160 --> 29:36.590
came to a realization.

29:37.110 --> 29:38.070
If I can

29:38.090 --> 29:39.750
uncover the identity of this leader

29:39.750 --> 29:41.490
and find out
what the Nightwalkers are really after,

29:41.490 --> 29:43.240
that would be a major achievement.

29:43.240 --> 29:45.310
It'd definitely help
the Eighteenth Prince's path

29:45.310 --> 29:46.680
to the Eastern Palace

29:46.680 --> 29:48.030
and my own career too.

29:51.460 --> 29:53.990
So that's why
you're not afraid of me anymore.

29:55.550 --> 29:57.710
You figured that part out.

30:01.510 --> 30:02.560
But

30:03.090 --> 30:04.520
the two maids just now

30:04.920 --> 30:06.030
are Yingqiu

30:06.030 --> 30:07.310
and Zhixia, right?

30:08.920 --> 30:10.960
I heard the three of you grew up together

30:10.960 --> 30:12.020
like real sisters.

30:13.060 --> 30:14.720
I might not be able to kill you,

30:15.110 --> 30:16.590
but killing them?

30:17.110 --> 30:18.550
That'd be easy.

30:24.230 --> 30:26.300
Bad guys really do stay bad, huh?

30:26.540 --> 30:27.440
You love

30:27.440 --> 30:29.640
using someone else's weakness as leverage.

30:29.640 --> 30:32.520
Zhixia and Yingqiu
never did anything to offend you.

30:32.520 --> 30:34.390
If you drag them into this,

30:34.840 --> 30:36.570
won't it weigh on

30:37.790 --> 30:39.580
your conscience at all?

30:57.640 --> 30:59.300
What's this supposed to mean?

31:01.030 --> 31:02.440
Can't you see?

31:02.440 --> 31:05.160
Those arrows are poisoned.

31:10.070 --> 31:11.420
They're aimed at her?

31:15.930 --> 31:17.140
What do you want?

31:17.680 --> 31:18.960
What do I want?

31:20.200 --> 31:21.550
I want you

31:22.030 --> 31:23.430
to take off your clothes,

31:24.150 --> 31:26.200
kneel to me, and call me Queen.

31:28.240 --> 31:29.480
You've got a death wish.

31:29.480 --> 31:30.170
What queen?

31:30.200 --> 31:31.070
You heard me!

31:31.070 --> 31:31.990
A queen is a queen.

31:31.990 --> 31:33.080
You idiot.

31:35.500 --> 31:37.030
Are you going to do it or not?

31:37.800 --> 31:39.130
You don't want to?

31:51.270 --> 31:52.240
I'm a prince.

31:53.570 --> 31:55.150
I only kneel to the emperor.

31:55.440 --> 31:57.080
I won't kneel to anyone else.

31:58.920 --> 32:00.520
Come up with something else.

32:01.070 --> 32:02.220
Fine.

32:02.350 --> 32:03.860
I'll make it simple for you.

32:03.860 --> 32:05.990
Take off your clothes and call me Boss.

32:11.270 --> 32:13.030
With this many arrows aimed at me,

32:13.030 --> 32:15.630
even the noble Seventh Prince

32:15.920 --> 32:17.850
wouldn't make it out alive, right?

32:22.200 --> 32:22.640
Wait.

32:25.000 --> 32:25.680
I'll do it.

32:34.510 --> 32:36.970
Why is it taking you forever
just to undress?

32:37.680 --> 32:38.550
Your belt.

32:38.750 --> 32:40.510
Remove it too.

32:44.110 --> 32:45.860
You princes

32:46.040 --> 32:48.340
put on so many pieces
of clothing every day.

32:48.340 --> 32:50.010
One layer after another.

32:50.040 --> 32:51.240
Isn't it exhausting?

32:53.350 --> 32:54.570
Don't look at me like that.

32:54.570 --> 32:55.890
Listen, Nan,

32:55.920 --> 32:57.900
I'm not taking advantage of you.

32:57.930 --> 33:00.060
I'm teaching you how to be a decent man.

33:00.210 --> 33:02.950
I'm kindly teaching you
how to respect others.

33:03.030 --> 33:04.350
Don't think just because
you're the male lead

33:04.350 --> 33:05.950
you can do whatever you want.

33:19.260 --> 33:20.660
What did you just call me?

33:22.530 --> 33:23.700
Nan?

33:27.030 --> 33:28.700
W-What else?

33:28.730 --> 33:31.190
You wanna take my last name
and become a Song?

33:35.950 --> 33:37.150
I'm warning you,

33:38.000 --> 33:39.000
stay away from me.

33:40.430 --> 33:42.960
What happened to
all that arrogance just now?

33:44.880 --> 33:46.680
Didn't you tell me to undress

33:46.700 --> 33:48.060
and kneel to you?

33:53.070 --> 33:53.880
Fine.

33:55.300 --> 33:56.560
Then I'll undress too.

34:03.520 --> 34:04.990
Now you're scared, huh?

34:05.270 --> 34:06.980
Even if you take off your clothes now,

34:06.980 --> 34:08.170
I still won't…

34:12.320 --> 34:13.110
Song Yi…

34:15.920 --> 34:17.800
You won't what, Your Highness?

34:18.010 --> 34:19.010
Say it.

34:19.739 --> 34:21.060
Say it, Your Highness.

34:21.400 --> 34:22.320
Where did a girl like you

34:22.320 --> 34:23.480
even get all this stuff?

34:23.480 --> 34:24.989
To deal with a big villain like you,

34:24.989 --> 34:26.989
of course I had to be well-prepared.

34:27.620 --> 34:28.520
See this?

34:28.550 --> 34:29.920
Real gunpowder.

34:29.949 --> 34:31.600
One spark,

34:31.790 --> 34:33.760
and you'll be blown to pieces.

34:34.770 --> 34:36.400
You're not afraid of dying with me?

34:36.400 --> 34:37.400
Cut the crap!

34:38.710 --> 34:39.960
Promise me one thing,

34:39.980 --> 34:41.120
or

34:41.380 --> 34:43.710
I'll blow us both up right now.

34:45.820 --> 34:46.800
What do you want?

34:47.880 --> 34:49.969
Let me marry Chu Guihong.

34:51.370 --> 34:52.570
Impossible!

34:53.030 --> 34:55.699
[Room of Elegance]

35:01.600 --> 35:02.700
Shut up.

35:03.280 --> 35:04.780
I didn't even say anything yet.

35:04.780 --> 35:06.400
Like you'd ever
say anything decent anyway.

35:06.400 --> 35:07.590
Miss Song said

35:07.590 --> 35:08.880
the Seventh Prince is no good.

35:08.880 --> 35:09.590
You work for him,

35:09.590 --> 35:11.120
so you must be terrible too.

35:11.190 --> 35:12.480
Hold on, how could you

35:12.480 --> 35:13.940
judge someone so arbitrarily?

35:13.940 --> 35:15.150
Yingqiu, Zhixia,

35:15.170 --> 35:16.280
is Yimeng inside?

35:18.800 --> 35:19.920
Nan Heng is here too?

35:19.920 --> 35:20.710
No.

35:20.730 --> 35:21.810
No. Impossible.

35:23.290 --> 35:24.580
Chu Guihong?

35:32.880 --> 35:33.840
Well,

35:34.430 --> 35:36.800
your fiancé is right outside.

35:37.000 --> 35:39.320
If he sees us dressed like this,

35:39.670 --> 35:40.800
what would he think?

35:43.320 --> 35:44.230
What are you trying to do?

35:44.230 --> 35:45.270
What do you think?

35:45.730 --> 35:46.860
No, no.

35:59.190 --> 35:59.840
Get up.

35:59.840 --> 36:01.150
Don't move. Don't move.

36:01.150 --> 36:02.630
I won't let you out.

36:02.650 --> 36:04.030
Song Yimeng, get off me!

36:04.030 --> 36:05.470
No, no!

36:06.370 --> 36:07.990
Don't move! Don't move!

36:08.410 --> 36:09.870
Song Yimeng.

36:10.100 --> 36:11.080
Chu Gui…

36:11.900 --> 36:13.110
I told you to be quiet!

36:13.110 --> 36:14.490
Can't you understand?

36:16.280 --> 36:17.360
Chu Gui…

36:19.480 --> 36:22.140
Now you can't make a sound.

36:22.320 --> 36:24.150
I swear I'll never complain
about romantic dramas again.

36:24.150 --> 36:26.630
This really does work in key moments.

36:28.190 --> 36:29.250
What are you doing?

36:30.440 --> 36:31.250
Aren't the two of them

36:31.250 --> 36:32.800
holding your arms too?

36:34.000 --> 36:34.730
Let go!

36:38.080 --> 36:39.470
Tell your master,

36:39.700 --> 36:41.520
if it's about politics, come at me

36:41.520 --> 36:42.980
and stay away from Yimeng.

36:45.090 --> 36:46.210
Hong.

36:46.400 --> 36:47.400
Why are you here?

36:48.000 --> 36:48.620
Yimeng.

36:49.910 --> 36:50.740
Hong.

36:50.840 --> 36:52.400
Let's go look at flowers in the garden.

36:52.400 --> 36:52.880
Let's go.

36:52.880 --> 36:53.630
Yimeng.

36:53.420 --> 36:55.420
[Room of Elegance]

36:53.630 --> 36:54.400
Let's go.

36:54.400 --> 36:55.150
Yimeng.

37:06.840 --> 37:07.850
Yimeng.

37:11.140 --> 37:13.720
[A moment ago]

37:18.770 --> 37:20.050
The third time.

37:24.720 --> 37:26.520
What do you mean, the third time?

37:42.780 --> 37:43.970
Your Highness,

37:44.040 --> 37:45.260
don't tell me

37:45.290 --> 37:46.020
you sit at home every day

37:46.020 --> 37:48.080
secretly thinking about this stuff?

37:49.180 --> 37:50.180
Well, yeah.

37:50.200 --> 37:51.510
Once in the royal garden.

37:51.510 --> 37:53.020
Once in the lake.

37:53.050 --> 37:55.480
So this really is the third time.

37:58.920 --> 37:59.800
It's fine.

37:59.800 --> 38:00.780
You're a man after all.

38:00.780 --> 38:01.970
Loosen up a bit.

38:02.110 --> 38:03.440
A kiss is just a kiss.

38:03.440 --> 38:04.760
At least I'm good-looking.

38:04.760 --> 38:05.480
Shut up.

38:09.920 --> 38:10.840
Your Highness,

38:10.990 --> 38:12.190
what kind of "shut up"

38:12.400 --> 38:13.670
do you mean exactly?

38:17.190 --> 38:18.310
Stop pouting.

38:18.430 --> 38:20.640
It's not like
I got anything out of it, okay?

38:20.640 --> 38:21.670
Why so upset?

38:21.670 --> 38:22.480
Enough!

38:27.710 --> 38:28.770
Listen carefully.

38:29.460 --> 38:30.520
Within three days,

38:30.880 --> 38:32.510
give me what I want.

38:33.200 --> 38:35.130
Then I'll let you marry right away.

38:35.590 --> 38:36.400
Otherwise,

38:37.190 --> 38:38.590
I can repeat what happened

38:38.590 --> 38:41.360
in the kapok forest again and again.

38:41.550 --> 38:43.210
I might not be able to hurt you,

38:43.280 --> 38:45.750
but I have plenty of ways
to make Chu Guihong

38:45.770 --> 38:47.260
wish he were dead.

38:50.070 --> 38:50.760
But…

38:51.670 --> 38:53.340
isn't three days a bit tight?

38:53.370 --> 38:54.550
Can't we talk this out?

38:54.550 --> 38:55.030
Five days maybe?

38:55.030 --> 38:55.760
Two days.

38:57.320 --> 38:58.480
You're just being unreasonable.

38:58.480 --> 38:59.150
One day.

38:59.660 --> 39:00.490
Two days.

39:00.630 --> 39:01.510
Just two days.

39:03.710 --> 39:04.840
But, Your Highness,

39:05.610 --> 39:07.480
I have a small favor to ask.

39:07.630 --> 39:09.190
When you leave later,

39:09.520 --> 39:10.850
can you go out that way?

39:11.680 --> 39:12.560
That way.

39:21.000 --> 39:21.710
Your Highness,

39:21.710 --> 39:23.150
aren't we here to deal with Song Yimeng?

39:22.480 --> 39:26.260
[Song Residence]

39:23.150 --> 39:24.930
If we leave like this,
won't it just boost her ego?

39:24.930 --> 39:27.060
She even made you
climb out the window.

39:27.710 --> 39:28.480
Your Highness.

39:28.480 --> 39:29.070
You...

39:29.090 --> 39:29.900
You...

39:39.770 --> 39:41.740
Chu Guihong was invited here by Song Yude?

39:41.740 --> 39:42.750
Yes.

39:42.950 --> 39:44.750
They had a long talk in the study.

39:45.460 --> 39:46.920
Looks like the Song family

39:47.290 --> 39:49.950
is getting involved
in the fight for the throne.

39:50.280 --> 39:52.500
If we don't kill Song Yimeng,

39:52.980 --> 39:54.590
she'll become a threat down the line.

39:54.590 --> 39:55.560
Your Highness,

39:55.580 --> 39:57.020
Song Yimeng is cunning,

39:57.050 --> 39:58.550
and now she's got the upper hand on you.

39:58.550 --> 39:59.190
That's...

39:59.860 --> 40:01.390
I may not be able to kill her,

40:02.000 --> 40:02.940
but that doesn't mean

40:02.940 --> 40:04.570
I'm at the end of my rope.

40:06.160 --> 40:08.030
Send word to Waning River Crescent.

40:08.030 --> 40:10.450
It's time they proved their worth.
